  "combos": {
    "combo1": {
      "title": "Dragonfly-Centipede Loop into a Triple Xyz End Board",
      "description": "A Dragonfly-opened line that leans on the repeatable Inzektor Ladybug equip-and-send loop to keep re-triggering Inzektor Dragonfly and Inzektor Centipede's non-once-per-turn effects. Each equip cycle chains into another Special Summon or search, snowballing through Zektrike Kou-ou and Inzektor Hornet to refill the hand and Graveyard. Number 60: Dugares the Timeless is Xyz Summoned early to power the swarm before being spent as Fusion Material, and two copies of Snake-Eyes Doomed Dragon are Fusion Summoned off Inzektor Giga-Mantis and Inzektor Giga-Weevil before themselves becoming the Xyz Material for Number 90: Galaxy-Eyes Photon Lord. The line closes on a three-monster board of Number 38: Hope Harbinger Dragon Titanic Galaxy, Number 90: Galaxy-Eyes Photon Lord, and Number 3: Cicada King, with Inzektor Sword - Zektkaliber left in the Graveyard for follow-up.",
      "date": "August 7, 2026",
